sequenceDiagram 
  participant UI as Next.js client
  participant API as Usecases (app layer)
  participant Redis as Redis lock + pub/sub
  participant WS as ws-server
  participant Others as Other clients in store

  UI->>WS: connect, join-store, join-item
  UI->>API: acquire / refresh / release (not wired yet)
  API->>Redis: SET NX / Lua refresh / Lua release
  API->>Redis: PUBLISH domain-events
  Redis->>WS: subscribe domain-events
  WS->>Others: emit item.locked / denied / unlocked